      <body>
         <head>Rock of Ages</head>
         <author>Augustus Toplady</author>
         <p rend="color(#000000)">{{GUTENBERG_LICENSE}}</p>
         <p rend="start color(#000000)">en-gutenberg-odts/t/TopladyAugustus-RockOfAges_2008.odt</p>
         <p>Inside front cover</p>
         <p>Flowers</p>
         <head>Rock of Ages</head>
         <subtitle>COPYRIGHT, 1909, BY<lb/>CUPPLES &amp; LEON COMPANY<lb/>NEW YORK</subtitle>
         <pb/>
         <div type="div1">
            <head>Rock of Ages</head>
            <p rend="justify">Title page</p>
            <lg>
               <l>The Lord is my rock</l>
               <l>and my fortress. 2 Sam. XXII 2.</l>
            </lg>
            <lg>
               <l>Rock of ages cleft for me,</l>
               <l>Let me hide myself in Thee;</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">Page 1</p>
            <lg>
               <l>Let the water and blood,</l>
               <l>From thy riven side which flow'd,</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">Page 2</p>
            <lg>
               <l>Be of sin the double cure,</l>
               <l>Cleanse me from its guilt and power.</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">Page 3</p>
            <p rend="justify">Ocean waves</p>
            <lg>
               <l>Not the labors of my hands</l>
               <l>Can fulfil Thy laws demands;</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">Page 5</p>
            <p rend="justify">Birds</p>
            <lg>
               <l>Could my zeal no respite know,</l>
               <l>Could my tears for ever flow,</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">Page 7</p>
            <p rend="justify">Angel</p>
            <lg>
               <l>All for sin could not atone,</l>
               <l>Thou must save, and Thou alone,</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">Page 9</p>
            <lg>
               <l>Nothing in my hand I bring,</l>
               <l>Simply to thy cross I cling;</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">Page 10</p>
            <p rend="justify">Flowers</p>
            <lg>
               <l>Naked, come to Thee for dress;</l>
               <l>Helpless look to Thee for grace;</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">Page 12</p>
            <p rend="justify">Angel</p>
            <lg>
               <l>Foul, I to the fountain fly;</l>
               <l>Wash me, Savior, or I die.</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">Page 14</p>
            <p rend="justify">Flowers</p>
            <lg>
               <l>While I draw this fleeting breath,</l>
               <l>When my eyelids close in death,</l>
               <l>When I soar thro' tracts unknown,</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">Page 16</p>
            <p rend="justify">Woman</p>
            <p rend="justify">Angel</p>
            <lg>
               <l>See Thee on Thy judgment throne,</l>
               <l>Rock of ages, cleft for me,</l>
               <l>Let me hide myself in thee.</l>
               <l/>
               <l>A. M. Toplady</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">Page 19</p>
            <p rend="justify">Holly</p>
            <p rend="justify">Inside back cover</p>
         </div>
      </body>
